  "feesApplyText": "Booking & Cancellation Terms\n\nSecuring your booking:\nTo reserve your apartment, we take a non-refundable initial payment equal to one week s rent. We will then send your first invoice, which must be paid by bank transfer within [3 working days] to confirm the booking. Once it is paid, you will receive your booking confirmation and check-in instructions.\n\nChanges to your booking:\nWe will do our best to accommodate changes to your booking, subject to availability.\n\nCancelling before arrival:\nAll cancellations must be made in writing, and it is your responsibility to make sure we receive your notice. If you cancel all or part of your booking before your check-in date, a cancellation fee equal to 30 days  rent applies, and the initial payment is not refunded.\n\nCancelling after check-in or leaving early:\nIf you cancel after your check-in date has passed, the first 90 nights of your stay will be charged. After the first 90 nights, you can shorten your stay by giving at least 30 days  written notice. Any unused nights after your notice period ends will be refunded.\n\nNon-arrival:\nIf you do not arrive, your booking will not be refunded.\n\nTerms can vary by building. Your consultant will confirm the exact terms for your apartment before you book.",
